{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56279","headline":"中秋月 · 李尧夫","name":"中秋月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"栖禽移昼向空飞，林麓虚明水大肥。\n万国仰瞻当此夕，片云争合闭清辉。\n羣妖始觉神通小，列宿应慙照耀微。\n达曙何人最关念，庾公楼上独忘机。\n（见《古今岁时杂咏》卷三十一。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李尧夫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56279.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56279","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}